        "notes": "<dp-prose>\n  <p>The Calder valley in Calderdale has regularly suffered from flooding, due to the topography of the area. This dataset was initially created to provide data as part of the clean up operation from the Boxing Day Floods in 2015. It now has details of the work that continues to be carried out to recover from the flood.</p>\n</dp-prose>",
