          {
            "cache_last_updated": null,
            "cache_url": null,
            "created": "2026-09-25T11:50:26.953510",
            "description": "Businesses were able to apply for a repair and renew grant of up to \u00a35,000. Property owners were encouraged to submit joint applications for the grant which helped them to get better value for money from their grants. Eg. 10\u00a0properties could add their grants together to have up to \u00a350,000 worth of work carried out.\nThe data includes part postcode,\u00a0number\u00a0of claims, number of\u00a0businesses and\u00a0amount paid. The Number of Claims column refers to the number of applications\u00a0from each area postcode area, some applications were for multiple properties. The\u00a0Number of\u00a0Business Properties\u00a0column refers to how many properties were covered and how many grant payments went out. The final column shows the total amount paid out for the postcode area.",
